                                                              <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "The baked dough of a pizza that its toppings rest on, a part of the pizza."@en ;
                                                              rdfs:label "pizza base"@en .


###  https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/PIZZABFO_0001002
<https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/PIZZABFO_0001002> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040> ;
                                                              <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A portion of food put on a pizza base before it is baked."@en ;
                                                              rdfs:label "pizza topping"@en .


