                                                              rdfs:label "thin and crispy base"@en .


###  https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/PIZZABFO_0001006
<https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/PIZZABFO_0001006> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                              rdfs:subClassOf <https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/PIZZABFO_0001001> ;
                                                              <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A thick pizza base baked in a pan."@en ;
                                                              rdfs:label "deep pan base"@en .


###  https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/PIZZABFO_0001007
<https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/PIZZABFO_0001007> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                              rdfs:subClassOf <https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-bfo/PIZZABFO_0001002> ;
